cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "sic-mosfet-devsim: simulation code, configurations and results of the study on multi-temperature inverse estimation and LLM-assisted TCAD sample selection for 4H-SiC planar MOSFETs"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code, frozen configurations, per-run raw data and analysis scripts for a study that
  estimates the JFET width, P-well doping and effective interface charge of a 4H-SiC planar MOSFET
  from DC characteristics simulated with DEVSIM at 300 K and 423 K, separates the multi-temperature
  gain from the gain of a repeated 300 K measurement, evaluates its dependence on high-temperature
  physics assumptions, and evaluates adaptive and LLM-assisted TCAD sample selection in a
  retrospective pool-based setting (manuscript V4.9; results at commit 90134a2 on branch
  exp/v4.7-controls).
